{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"62859dc89abb440b","type":"text","text":"[[Noble Houses.canvas]]\n\n[[Aralia Lumiere.canvas]]\n\n#NPC #Volstarian_Dynasty ","x":-1040,"y":-900,"width":340,"height":140},
		{"id":"f05086f0fc774271","x":-1040,"y":-700,"width":695,"height":560,"type":"text","text":"Daughter of Divina Cilindrath, Alivia Divina is the strongest mage currently alive and like her mother is a direct descendant of the Lumiere bloodline. Alivia has no knowledge of her mother or bloodline alike, raised as an orphan in Volstar under the guidance of the church. Alivia was always gifted with magic and at a young age was picked up by the Hellos academy where she being to learn it in depth. Her capabilities quickly outgrew what the instructors at the academy were able to teach and so the king at the time Ceasar asked the neighbouring nation Askain if the Archmage of house Thelyss would be willing to come to Volstar once a month a week at a time to train her. \n\nAnd so in the young elf's early years she was met with a woman barely older than her named Azest and for a few years Azest taught her all she new before the wars began and Azest was deemed KIA. \n\nFollowing that Alivia began to discover the secrets of the magic that this world is so dependent on, Arcana all comes for the dreams on the knowing mistress. Fascinated by this discovery Alivia wanted to learn more and over years of studied she became the only being in existence to receive a blessing from the dreamer Iuon. \n\nSome say Alivia is lucky some hardworking others a cheat, but nobody is aware of the blood running through her veins. No other beings could handle direct power from the dreamers Ceasar included and it is only those who have the heart or Lumiere blood running through their veins that would not go mad in pursuit of this power.\n"},
		{"id":"d89fc1024dfd9e70","x":-920,"y":160,"width":493,"height":372,"type":"text","text":"Exterior\n\n\nAt the highest point of the sky top district is the home of Alivia Divina a tower larger than most building in the stop but even bigger on the inside.\n\nThe exterior is gated of with a beautiful garden that has a fountain in the center of it, a statue of Iuon, the only depiction of the sleeping Goddess ever made for Alivia is the only one to truly know what she looks like.\n\nThe tower is 8 stories high from the outside. Made from Beautiful sapphire gold and white marble, the tower is a straight cylindrical column with balconies in areas and windows all throughout over looking the view of the city.\n"},
		{"id":"0cc3c14f96679c11","x":-293,"y":68,"width":153,"height":52,"type":"text","text":"Divina Tower\n"},
		{"id":"d8e1333e2326e334","x":-140,"y":160,"width":540,"height":200,"type":"text","text":"Bottom floor\n\nThe bottom floor of the tower is a grand entrance, floor of marble and sapphire, walls decorated with paintings from all over the world. \n\nIn the center is a red carpet that leads to an archway with an arcane elevator leading to the upper levels of the tower.\n"},
		{"id":"c9a09218b22eaae2","x":-140,"y":400,"width":513,"height":454,"type":"text","text":"Sixth floor\n\nThe elevator opens to the center of a raised platform with a staircases going down into a center main floor.\n\nSurrounded by stained glass showing the rise of arch mages throughout time from all over the world. \n\nThe floor made of white marble a red carpet running down the staircase leading to the main area in the center.\n\nAround the center elevated area with a railing looking into the center and at the very back of the large room is a open door leading to a balcony.\n\nThe center area has a elaborate chandelier, nearly the size of the floor it self made of red ruby and sapphires with magical motes illuminating the entire room.\n"},
		{"id":"3f682507d71d2aa6","x":-293,"y":-700,"width":553,"height":220,"type":"text","text":"Alivia Is a kind woman young for an elf she is 100 years old. \n\nAlivia wants the best for both her world and nation. With the current king in despair, she has taken on a lot of the royal duties and some in Volstar believe she should be considered its Queen. \n\nAlivia wants to discover the secrets of the world and expand her knowledge, sharing it with the world.\n"},
		{"id":"a8dbe834a7774003","x":-293,"y":-420,"width":267,"height":400,"type":"file","file":"Volstarian Dynasty/Pelor's Planes/Volstar/Images/Pasted image 20260916132045.png"},
		{"id":"51e14739d605ca49","x":20,"y":-420,"width":267,"height":400,"type":"file","file":"Volstarian Dynasty/Pelor's Planes/Volstar/Images/Pasted image 20260916132051.png"},
		{"id":"c2d98f8d09a84c4d","x":320,"y":-420,"width":267,"height":400,"type":"file","file":"Volstarian Dynasty/Pelor's Planes/Volstar/Images/Pasted image 20260916132057.png"}
	],
